  "manual.blocks.pet_bowl.1": "The pet bowl can be used as an alternative to the Trough on your farm. It is primarily intended for smaller animals, like cats, dogs, and hamsters. These are the items that can be placed in the pet bowl:",
  "manual.blocks.pet_bowl.2": "This is the crafting recipe for it:",
  "manual.blocks.decorations.1": "The following blocks are purely cosmetic and don't currently serve a purpose. The Cat Tower is crafted like this:",
  "manual.blocks.decorations.2": "The Litter Box is crafted like this:",
  "manual.blocks.decorations.3": "The Dog House is crafted like this:",
  "manual.blocks.animal_beds.1": "There are two different beds for cats:",
  "manual.blocks.animal_beds.2": "And for dogs there is a pillow:",
  "manual.dogs.general.1": "All dogs behave in a similar way. They all attack Animals such as Goats, Sheep and Rabbits when they are untamed. Tamed animals will not attack. When tamed, they will defend their owner and follow their commands. Dogs do not spawn naturally in the world, but can be purchased from the pet merchant villager. These are their food items:",
  "manual.dogs.general.2": "They sleep on these blocks:",
  "manual.cats.general.1": "All cats behave in a similar way. They attack small Animals like chicks, peachicks, frogs, hamsters, ferrets and hedgehogs. Tamed cats will not attack. Cats do not spawn naturally in the world, but can be purchased from the pet merchant villager. These are their food items:",
  "manual.cats.general.2": "They sleep on these blocks:",
  "manual.cats.generic.1": "cats look like this:",
  "manual.dogs.generic.1": "dogs look like this:",
  "manual.dogs.german_shepherd": "German Shepherd dogs also have a special ability: Any sheep or goats near them will follow their movement patterns, so if the dogs follow the player, the sheep will follow the dog and hereby the player. They are very useful to keep around on your farm.",
  "manual.canids.general.1": "All canids behave in a similar way. They all attack Animals such as Goats, Sheep and Rabbits when they are untamed. Tamed animals will not attack. When tamed, they will defend their owner and follow their commands. They spawn naturally in the world. These are their food items:",
  "manual.canids.fox.1": "Foxes look like this:",
  "manual.canids.wolf.1": "Wolves look like this:",
  "manual.felids.general.1": "All Felids behave in a similar way. They attack small Animals like chicks, peachicks, frogs, hamsters, ferrets and hedgehogs. Tamed animals will not attack. Felids spawn naturally in the world. These are their food items:",
  "manual.felids.ocelot.1": "Ocelots look like this:",
